It is an adapted copy prepared for use with BODex (cuRobo); in this repository its mesh paths are replaced by a
placeholder that is resolved to a local checkout of the official repository at run time. No mesh files are
redistributed here.

The generation configs under configs/generation/ are based on the Shadow Hand configs shipped with BODex
(https://github.com/JYChen18/BODex).
